---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import chatbottaLogo from '../assets/chatbotta.png';
import skiesoftLogo from '../assets/skiesoft.png';
---

<section class="investments-section">
	<div class="section-container">
		<div class="section-header">
			<h2 class="section-title">Investments</h2>
			<p class="section-subtitle">我投資的未來科技</p>
		</div>

		<div class="investments-grid">
			<div class="investment-card">
				<div class="card-content">
					<div class="logo-wrapper">
						<Image src={chatbottaLogo} alt="Chatbotta Logo" class="company-logo" loading="eager" />
					</div>
					<h3 class="company-name">創易聊股份有限公司</h3>
					<p class="company-description">
						想像一下，如果聊天機器人不只會說「您好，有什麼可以幫您的嗎？」而是真的能理解你的需求！這就是創易聊在做的事 —— 用視覺化設計器讓 AI 變得更聰明，讓客服不再是惡夢。
					</p>
					<a href="https://chatbotta.com" target="_blank" class="company-link">查看官網 →</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="investment-card">
				<div class="card-content">
					<div class="logo-wrapper">
						<Image src={skiesoftLogo} alt="Skiesoft Logo" class="company-logo" loading="eager" />
					</div>
					<h3 class="company-name">軟雲股份有限公司</h3>
					<p class="company-description">
						終於有人做出懂台灣人說話的 AI 了！不管你說國語、台語還是英文，甚至是三種語言混著說，軟雲 AI 都聽得懂。這就是我們要的台灣 AI 基礎建設！
					</p>
					<a href="https://skiesoft.com/" target="_blank" class="company-link">查看官網 →</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.investments-section {
		min-height: 100vh;
		background: #000;
		color: #fff;
		padding: 6rem 2rem;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.section-container {
		max-width: 1400px;
		width: 100%;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.section-header {
		margin-bottom: 5rem;
		border-bottom: 2px solid #fff;
		padding-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.section-title {
		font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
		font-weight: 300;
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
		line-height: 1;
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
		color: #fff;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.section-subtitle {
		font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem);
		font-weight: 200;
		color: #fff;
		opacity: 0.7;
		margin: 0;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
	}

	.investments-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
		gap: 3rem;
	}

	.investment-card {
		background: #000;
		border: 2px solid #fff;
		overflow: hidden;
		transition: all 0.2s ease;
		position: relative;
	}

	.investment-card::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		right: 0;
		bottom: 0;
		background: #fff;
		transform: scaleY(0);
		transform-origin: bottom;
		transition: transform 0.3s ease;
		z-index: 0;
	}

	.investment-card:hover::before {
		transform: scaleY(1);
		transform-origin: top;
	}

	.investment-card:hover {
		border-color: #000;
	}

	.investment-card:hover .card-content,
	.investment-card:hover .company-name,
	.investment-card:hover .company-description,
	.investment-card:hover .company-link {
		color: #000;
	}

	.card-content {
		padding: 3rem;
		position: relative;
		z-index: 1;
		transition: color 0.3s ease;
	}

	.logo-wrapper {
		width: 100px;
		height: 100px;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		border: 2px solid #fff;
		background: #fff;
		transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
	}

	.investment-card:hover .logo-wrapper {
		border-color: #000;
	}

	.company-logo {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: contain;
		padding: 0.5rem;
	}

	.company-name {
		font-size: 1.75rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
		color: #fff;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		transition: color 0.3s ease;
	}

	.company-description {
		font-size: 1.125rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: #fff;
		opacity: 0.9;
		margin: 0 0 2rem 0;
		transition: color 0.3s ease;
	}

	.company-link {
		display: inline-block;
		color: #fff;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 1rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		border-bottom: 2px solid #fff;
		padding-bottom: 0.25rem;
		transition: all 0.3s ease;
	}

	.investment-card:hover .company-link {
		color: #000;
		border-bottom-color: #000;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.investments-section {
			padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
		}

		.section-header {
			margin-bottom: 3rem;
		}

		.investments-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 2rem;
		}

		.card-content {
			padding: 2rem;
		}
	}
</style>
